# A trainer's own saved work, written by the მონაცემები button and read back by
# the app on startup. It sits beside the built page on purpose, so shipping a
# new build cannot touch it — which also means it is not source.
bekura3d-data.js

# Tile cache. data/make-maps.sh refills it from OpenStreetMap and Esri; it is a
# few hundred megabytes of somebody else's tiles and does not belong in git.
data/tiles/

# Throwaway Chrome profile left by data/make-data.sh. Holds Cookies and
# Login Data. The script is kept, the profile is not.
data/cprof/

# OS and editor noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
